boundary: "IN: the WS transport + connector (a new `transport_registry.py` factory, LISTEN-role); the full connection lifecycle (connect -> pre-binding -> select-tenant-bus -> bound -> switch); the per-tenant peer relationship inside [CXC-CS-MULTI-TENANCY]'s LOCKED cross-tenant boundary; the subscription filter (explicit + default-deny, reusing [CXC-SUB-DECLARE]); retained-state replay on subscribe, generalized to the CONNECTOR layer so UART/CAN inherit the same obligation; the wire format (the faithful `BusMessage.to_json()`/`from_json()` envelope, encode/decode only); the peer-identity provisioning policy (localStorage <-> NVS). OUT (referenced, not specified — their own units): the cross-tenant OPERATOR CONSOLE (bus-registry content + selection UX + the reserved auth gate, [DD-WS-AUTH-GATE]/[DD-WS-SWITCH-UX] only name the seam this spec must not foreclose); the ComposeUX HTML/DOM render backend (render-engineer's domain, [DEC-COMPOSEIO-EXTENSIONS-ROADMAP-2026-08] item 9's `bus_views`); scene-bundle serving (the config-over-bus / `bus_storage` seam, [SPEC:CXC-CONFIG-BUS], only cited)."
