- provenance: architect-synthesis
- part-of: [SPEC:CXC-WS]
- see-also: [CXC-VISION-PLACEMENT], [CXC-CS-PLACEMENT], [CXC-CBK-PLACEMENT], [CXC-CSL-PLACEMENT]

